"VXNlcjoyODc1NDAyMg==",profile_bio:$R[500]={description:"crypto trader since 2013 / ex co-founder of social network apps with 50+ million users"}}}},counts:$R[501]={favorite_count:316,reply_count:46},details:$R[502]={full_text:"“交易时光机” 产品近两天vibe coding新改进：\n1️⃣开关显示未来K线\n2️⃣资金/盈亏曲线，和K线图上下对齐\n\n感觉有机会长期迭代\n理想状态是，人人可用的可视化交易复盘工具，\n或者可以是博主对历史交易的“解说工具”\n\n用一段典中典的大亏经历，\n20天亏掉3个多月交易成果+低位止损\n来演示下目前大致效果⬇️ https://t.co/jpDeRY6r0z",smarttags:$R[503]=[]},id:"VHdlZXQ6MTk5NjQ2NzUyMzkxMTY2MzY1Mw=="}}}}}}))($R["tsr"]);document.currentScript.remove()</script><div hidden id="S:0"><div class="relative h-full overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[600px]" id="urt:conversation:1996467523911663653:none:default"><ul><li><div class="outline-blue-500 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 px-horizontal py-vertical border-b border-gray-100" data-timeline-entry="" tabindex="-1"><article class="flex flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex w-10 shrink-0 justify-center self-stretch"><div class="relative z-10"><a class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] rounded-none active" href="/coolish" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><div class="shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-full size-10 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90"><img alt="@coolish" class="size-full object-cover" draggable="false" loading="lazy" sizes="40px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1548729057994452992/Kcs8r3YR_normal.jpg" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1548729057994452992/Kcs8r3YR_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1548729057994452992/Kcs8r3YR_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1548729057994452992/Kcs8r3YR_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1548729057994452992/Kc